@translation unitary en project
@unit 1
@span i 1' - ii 1
....

@unit 2
@span ii 2 - ii 10
He transported diorite from the mountains of Magan, fashioned his statue from it, named it for her his sake “As I am ... loved by his master, may my life be prolonged!”, and brought it before him into the E-ninnu. 

@unit 3
@span iii 1 - iii 19
Whoever erases its inscription, removes ..., or curtails its regular offering, (which is now) 1 @sila of flour (and) 1 @sila of groats of husked emmer, may Ninŋirsu, the king of the weapons, Bau, the child of An, and Ig-alim and Šulšagana, the beloved children of Ninŋirsu, uproot him, (and) put an end to his lineage!




